  "cause": "The original RK108 source used JSON ASCII escaping to author a language String token. LANG-001 does not support backslash-u escapes, so the source refuses lexically before reaching the intended Unicode output-key domain boundary. Its expected semantic details and ASCII-escaped JSON diagnostic message were already correct.",
